    "body": "Merge-batch refresh: merged upstream/main into the branch (new head d19e670f). Hand-resolved hunks (remerge-diff: `fidelity_law.rs` +4/-10, `coarse_laws.rs` +2/-8):\n\n1. `crates/app/src/operation/fidelity_law.rs` `excess_aware`: kept this PR's `Section::Plasma => true` and main's new arm as `Section::WireEdm | Section::Sinker => false` (with main's #532/#541 comments). Doc comment's \"Not yet\" list now reads swarf, cone/engrave rides, cross drill, the wire (#532) and the sinker (#541) - probe and plasma dropped from it, as in this PR.\n2. `crates/app/tests/coarse_laws.rs` refused list: main's list minus `Probe` and `PlasmaProfile` (keeps `WireContour`, `SinkerBurn`, `SinkerSideBurn`); kept main's #532/#541/#545 comments, with SinkerBurn's stale \"refused like plasma\" changed to \"refused until it reads the excess\".\n\nGate (debug, macOS): camcraft-motion lib `plasma` 17 passed; camcraft-app plasma_profile 7, plasma_machine 6, plasma_post 5, plasma_gate 6, plasma_post_refusals 7, probe_op 12, coarse_probe_plasma 7, coarse_laws 6, golden_cl 26 - all passed, 0 failed; `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\nReady for a delta review of the remerge-diff.\n",
