    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: d19e670fa47f2b6ef2d47cfb7b9e0f82123452bd -->\n**Delta review (M3) of the merge-batch refresh at d19e670f: clean.** The remerge-diff touches two files (+6/-18), and both sides are kept.\n\n- **`fidelity_law.rs` `excess_aware`:** `Section::Plasma => true` (this PR) sits beside main's `Section::WireEdm | Section::Sinker => false`. The \"Not yet\" doc list now names the cone and engrave rides, the cross drill, the wire (#532) and the sinker (#541).\n- **`tests/coarse_laws.rs` `refused`:** this is main's list minus `Probe` and `PlasmaProfile`, which read the excess since this PR: `[Swarf, AdvancedSwarf, Trace, Engrave, Chamfer2D, Deburr, WireContour, SinkerBurn, SinkerSideBurn]`. The stale \"like plasma\" wording in the SinkerBurn comment is corrected.\n- **The author's gate on this head:** the plasma tests (17) and 9 app suites pass, and clippy is clean. The PR merges cleanly with main.\n",
